'''Ghosty''' is a [[common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[Halloween Event 2016#Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[halloween Event 2016|2016 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.[[File:Fh.png|thumb|1x1px]]
== Appearance==

Its blade is white with a small ghost face with curves as the ghost's white fabric sheet and with faded white blushes on it. The guard is silver, and the handle is solid black.

==Trivia==

*This knife was obtained from the first Halloween event box ever in [[Murder Mystery 2]].

